Hi all,

Reflecting on the spoiler art2-343 (Hugo, Donnell), I did some number
crunching to compare melee weapons. Nothing really new except maybe
how non-artifact weapons behave.

My own biased assumptions on the weapon
- uncursed
- enchanted to +7
- hero has a +6 bonus damage (e.g. str 18/00 and no ring of increase
damage)

My own biased assumptions on the targeted monster:
- 50% small and 50%large
- 25% silver hating
- 33% of antagonizing alignment
- 75% cold resistant
- 75% level-drain resistant
- 80% fire resistant
- 10% demon
- 10% dragon
- 10% undead
- 3% troll
- 2% ogre
- 1% ogre
- beheading causes *2 damage
- bisecting causes *3 damage

